@batchUrl = http://localhost:5210
@reference = 77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777777

### El batchero responde sin necesitar SQL.
GET {{batchUrl}}/health

### Riesgo bajo
POST {{batchUrl}}/api/fraud/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionReference": "{{reference}}",
  "amount": 100,
  "previousDebitsIn15Minutes": 0,
  "knownDestination": false
}

### Riesgo alto por frecuencia
POST {{batchUrl}}/api/fraud/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionReference": "{{reference}}",
  "amount": 100,
  "previousDebitsIn15Minutes": 5,
  "knownDestination": true
}
